    {
      "type": "text", "id": "p2_dli_t",
      "x": 478, "y": 380, "width": 434, "height": 75,
      "text": "5 Parallel Specialist NLP Models (~62ms Total)\n1. SimCSE (s_sem)  2. KeyBERT (s_cov)  3. RoBERTa-CoLA (s_gra)\n4. RoBERTa-Formality (s_for)  5. DeBERTa-v3 NLI (s_log, P_c)\n-> Grade y = 10 * Sum(w_i(b) * s_i)   [Capped <= 4.0 if P_c > 0.90]",
      "originalText": "5 Parallel Specialist NLP Models (~62ms Total)\n1. SimCSE (s_sem)  2. KeyBERT (s_cov)  3. RoBERTa-CoLA (s_gra)\n4. RoBERTa-Formality (s_for)  5. DeBERTa-v3 NLI (s_log, P_c)\n-> Grade y = 10 * Sum(w_i(b) * s_i)   [Capped <= 4.0 if P_c > 0.90]",
      "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid",
